msgstr ""

msgid "A rule has one or more conditions and an action: a Koha category, or do not import. Conditions in one rule must all be true. Several values in one condition mean any of them. Rules are tried in priority order (lowest number first) and the first rule that matches decides. When no rule matches, the default category is used."
